GET/SET/SUBSCRIBE 処理）は内部で 大量の Redis client を作成し、Redis TCP…</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/redis-client-manager-rcm-hld/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:32:18 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/redis-client-manager-rcm-hld/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/redis-client-manager-rcm-hld.png" type="image/png" length="55405" /> </item> <item> <title>用語集 (Glossary)</title> <description>用語集 (Glossary) — SONiC NOS で頻出する固有用語・略語・コンポーネント名・データベース名・デーモン名を、アルファベット順に整理した日本語用語集です。各エントリは「用語 / 略称 / 日本語訳 / 簡潔な説明 / 関連ページ」の形式で記載しています。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:32:18 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png" type="image/png" length="30026" /> </item> <item> <title>DHCP_SERVER_IPV6 テーブル</title> <description>DHCP_SERVER_IPV6 テーブル — 組み込み DHCPv6 サーバ機能の設定テーブル（2026-05 時点で未実装。SONiC master は DHCPv6 リレーのみ対応）。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dhcp-server-ipv6/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:32:18 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/dhcp-server-ipv6/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/dhcp-server-ipv6.png" type="image/png" length="35086" /> </item> <item> <title>イベント/アラーム拡張監視設定 (extended-monitor)</title> <description>eventd が読み込む EVENT テーブル保持上限 (eventd.json) とイベントプロファイル (/etc/evprofile/default.json) を中心とした、event/alarm framework の拡張監視設定ガイド。CONFIG_DB テーブルではなくファイルベース設定として管理される。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/extended-monitor/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:32:18 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/extended-monitor/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/extended-monitor.png" type="image/png" length="37822" /> </item> <item> <title>SAG テーブル</title> <description>SAG テーブル — Static Anycast Gateway (SAG) のグローバル仮想 MAC アドレスを保持する CONFIG_DB テーブル。EVPN/VXLAN ファブリック内で全 leaf switch が同一ゲートウェイ IP/MAC を共有するために使用する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/sag/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:32:18 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/sag/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/sag.png" type="image/png" length="33403" /> </item> <item> <title>ARP / Neighbor エントリが古い IP-MAC を保持し続ける</title> <category>arp</category> <category>neighbor</category> <category>runbook</category> <description>Runbook: ARP テーブルが stale な MAC を返し続けて traffic が黒穴化する場合の切り分け</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/arp-entry-stuck/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:32:18 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/arp-entry-stuck/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/arp-entry-stuck.png" type="image/png" length="39008" /> </item> <item> <title>BGP Graceful Restart のネゴシエーションに失敗する</title> <category>bgp</category> <category>frr</category> <category>runbook</category> <description>Runbook: BGP Graceful Restart (GR) capability が対向と合致せず restart 時に経路断が発生する場合の切り分け</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/bgp-graceful-restart-failure/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:32:18 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/bgp-graceful-restart-failure/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/bgp-graceful-restart-failure.png" type="image/png" length="37847" /> </item> <item> <title>HLD と実装の乖離 一覧（discrepancy-index）</title> <description>HLD と実装の乖離 一覧（discrepancy-index） — verification: discrepancy-found が付いた全ページを monitor subtype 別に分類した一覧。meta/scripts/gen_discrepancy_index.py で生成。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:32:18 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/verification/discrepancy-index/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/verification/discrepancy-index.png" type="image/png" length="41531" /> </item> <item> <title>config interface サブコマンド</title> <description>config interface サブコマンド — config interface は物理ポート（PORT）・PortChannel・SubInterface・Loopback の state / 速度 / FEC / link-training / autoneg / breakout / MTU / TPID…</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-interface/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:23:04 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/config-interface/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/config-interface.png" type="image/png" length="34098" /> </item> <item> <title>sonic-cfggen コマンド</title> <description>sonic-cfggen コマンド — sonic-cfggen は SONiC 設定生成エンジンの汎用 CLI。click ベースの config / show とは別系統で、argparse で定義された引数を取る Python スクリプト。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/sonic-cfggen/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:23:04 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/sonic-cfggen/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/sonic-cfggen.png" type="image/png" length="33163" /> </item> <item> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title> <description>SONiC NOS (community master) を AI が日本語で再構成した非公式ドキュメント。学ぶ / 設定する / 修理する の 3 つの入り口から、全文検索可能なリファレンスへ。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:10:42 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/index.png" type="image/png" length="28011" /> </item> <item> <title>動的ポート add/del 制限事項と HLD との乖離（ref counter 未取り込み・race 残存）</title> <description>動的ポート add/del の制限事項と実装乖離。HLD が提案した port buffer ref counter（sonic-swss PR</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/enhancements-to-add-or-del-ports-dynamically-limitations/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:10:24 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/enhancements-to-add-or-del-ports-dynamically-limitations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/enhancements-to-add-or-del-ports-dynamically-limitations.png" type="image/png" length="41683" /> </item> <item> <title>ビルド時間最適化（Dockerfile レイヤ削減 / BuildKit / 並列 dh / sairedis 分離）</title> <description>ビルド時間最適化（Dockerfile レイヤ削減 / BuildKit / 並列 dh / sairedis 分離） — 本 HLD は主に第 2 段階に焦点を当て、4 つの最適化を提案する:</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/build-system-improvements/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:10:24 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/build-system-improvements/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/build-system-improvements.png" type="image/png" length="46022" /> </item> <item> <title>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テスト</title> <description>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テスト — 「DIP（destination IP）と SIP（source IP）が同じ」L3 パケットを SONiC スイッチが正しくルーティングできるかを PTF (Packet Test Framework) で検証 するテストの設計。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:10:24 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design.png" type="image/png" length="30488" /> </item> <item> <title>Smart Switch のデータベース構成（NPU 上の DPU overlay DB）</title> <description>Smart Switch のデータベース構成（NPU 上の DPU overlay DB） — DPU の DASH overlay 用 Redis を NPU 側に container として立て、DPU から midplane 経由で remote 接続 させる。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smart-switch-database-design/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:10:24 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smart-switch-database-design/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/smart-switch-database-design.png" type="image/png" length="51298" /> </item> <item> <title>Multi-ASIC / VOQ chassis 関連</title> <description>Multi-ASIC / VOQ chassis 関連 — このカテゴリは Multi-ASIC と VOQ chassis に関わるページを area 横断でまとめます。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/multi-asic/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 14:10:24 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/categories/multi-asic/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/categories/multi-asic.png" type="image/png" length="41010" /> </item> </channel> </rss>